---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for StudentKit.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-emerald text-gray-600">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>At StudentKit, your privacy is our priority. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle data when you use our website and tools.</p>
      
      <h2>2. Local Processing (No Data Collection)</h2>
      <p>All calculators and tools on StudentKit run entirely locally in your web browser using JavaScript. When you enter data (such as grades, attendance numbers, dates, or text), this information is <strong>never transmitted to, stored on, or processed by our servers</strong>. All calculations happen directly on your device.</p>
      
      <h2>3. Analytics and Cookies</h2>
      <p>StudentKit uses Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate website usage and improve the site. This service uses standard analytics cookies. We do not track individual users or collect personally identifiable information.</p>
      
      <h2>4. Third-Party Advertisements</h2>
      <p>StudentKit uses Google AdSense and other Google advertising services. These providers may use cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure, or personalize advertisements, which can be based on your visits to this site or other sites. You can manage personalized ads via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. Learn more about Google's advertising and privacy practices through Google's privacy resources.</p>
<p>For privacy questions, concerns, or requests, contact: <a href="mailto:sahilsleem01@gmail.com" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">sahilsleem01@gmail.com</a></p>
      
      <h2>5. External Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may contain links to external sites that are not operated by us. We have no control over the content and practices of these sites and cannot accept responsibility for their respective privacy policies.</p>
      
      <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
